# flutter-integration/workin_desktop/ and flutter-integration/workin_mobile/
# are git submodules (see .gitmodules), not gitignored — this repository
# only carries a pinned commit *reference* to each, not their file
# content. Neither is initialized by a plain `git clone` or by CI (no
# `--recurse-submodules`, no `git submodule update` in any workflow) —
# populating them locally is an explicit opt-in
# (`git submodule update --init`) requiring SSH access to those repos.
# Never run git commands *inside* either submodule directory that would
# push, commit, or otherwise modify them — reference only. See ADR-0001
# (docs/adr/ADR-0001-repository-strategy.md) for the full policy.

# Session-local git worktrees (never repository content)
.claude/worktrees/
.superpowers/

# Legacy upload target: runtime and test artifacts, never source.
backend/uploads/
uploads/
